ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja476:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja476:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja476:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:12.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:12.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja476:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:13.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja476:13.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja476:14.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja476:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja476:0.2": "Terasakanipāta ", "ja476:0.3": "Ambavagga ", "ja476:0.4": "3. Javanahaṁsajātaka ", "ja476:1.1": "“Idheva haṁsa nipata, ", "ja476:1.2": "piyaṁ me tava dassanaṁ; ", "ja476:1.3": "Issarosi anuppatto, ", "ja476:1.4": "yamidhatthi pavedaya”. ", "ja476:2.1": "“Savanena ekassa piyā bhavanti, ", "ja476:2.2": "Disvā panekassa viyeti chando; ", "ja476:2.3": "Disvā ca sutvā ca piyā bhavanti, ", "ja476:2.4": "Kaccinnu me pīyasi dassanena. ", "ja476:3.1": "Savanena piyo mesi, ", "ja476:3.2": "bhiyyo cāgamma dassanaṁ; ", "ja476:3.3": "Evaṁ piyadassano me, ", "ja476:3.4": "vasa haṁsa mamantike”. ", "ja476:4.1": "“Vaseyyāma tavāgāre, ", "ja476:4.2": "niccaṁ sakkatapūjitā; ", "ja476:4.3": "Matto ca ekadā vajje, ", "ja476:4.4": "‘haṁsarājaṁ pacantu me’”. ", "ja476:5.1": "“Dhiratthu taṁ majjapānaṁ, ", "ja476:5.2": "yaṁ me piyataraṁ tayā; ", "ja476:5.3": "Na cāpi majjaṁ pissāmi, ", "ja476:5.4": "yāva me vacchasī ghare”. ", "ja476:6.1": "“Suvijānaṁ siṅgālānaṁ, ", "ja476:6.2": "sakuṇānañca vassitaṁ; ", "ja476:6.3": "Manussavassitaṁ rāja, ", "ja476:6.4": "dubbijānataraṁ tato. ", "ja476:7.1": "Api ce maññatī poso, ", "ja476:7.2": "ñāti mitto sakhāti vā; ", "ja476:7.3": "Yo pubbe sumano hutvā, ", "ja476:7.4": "pacchā sampajjate diso. ", "ja476:8.1": "Yasmiṁ mano nivisati, ", "ja476:8.2": "avidūre sahāpi so; ", "ja476:8.3": "Santikepi hi so dūre, ", "ja476:8.4": "yasmiṁ nāvisate mano. ", "ja476:9.1": "Antopi so hoti pasannacitto, ", "ja476:9.2": "Pāraṁ samuddassa pasannacitto; ", "ja476:9.3": "Antopi so hoti paduṭṭhacitto, ", "ja476:9.4": "Pāraṁ samuddassa paduṭṭhacitto. ", "ja476:10.1": "Saṁvasantā vivasanti, ", "ja476:10.2": "ye disā te rathesabha; ", "ja476:10.3": "Ārā santo saṁvasanti, ", "ja476:10.4": "manasā raṭṭhavaḍḍhana. ", "ja476:11.1": "Aticiraṁ nivāsena, ", "ja476:11.2": "piyo bhavati appiyo; ", "ja476:11.3": "Āmanta kho taṁ gacchāma, ", "ja476:11.4": "purā te homa appiyā”. ", "ja476:12.1": "“Evañce yācamānānaṁ, ", "ja476:12.2": "Añjaliṁ nāvabujjhasi; ", "ja476:12.3": "Paricārakānaṁ sataṁ, ", "ja476:12.4": "Vacanaṁ na karosi no; ", "ja476:12.5": "Evaṁ taṁ abhiyācāma, ", "ja476:12.6": "Puna kayirāsi pariyāyaṁ”. ", "ja476:13.1": "“Evañce no viharataṁ, ", "ja476:13.2": "antarāyo na hessati; ", "ja476:13.3": "Tuyhañcāpi mahārāja, ", "ja476:13.4": "mayhañca raṭṭhavaḍḍhana; ", "ja476:13.5": "Appeva nāma passemu, ", "ja476:13.6": "ahorattānamaccaye”ti. ", "ja476:14.1": "Javanahaṁsajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja476:0.1": "", "ja476:0.2": "", "ja476:0.3": "", "ja476:0.4": "", "ja476:1.1": "", "ja476:1.2": "", "ja476:1.3": "", "ja476:1.4": "", "ja476:2.1": "", "ja476:2.2": "viyeti → vineti (sya1ed, sya2ed); viheti (pts-vp-pli1); vigeti (Ma-aka) ", "ja476:2.3": "", "ja476:2.4": "pīyasi → piyyasi (bj, pts-vp-pli1); piyasi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja476:3.1": "", "ja476:3.2": "", "ja476:3.3": "Evaṁ piyadassano me → evaṁ piyadassano samāno (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja476:3.4": "mamantike → mama santike (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja476:4.1": "", "ja476:4.2": "", "ja476:4.3": "vajje → vajjā (bj, pts-vp-pli1); majjaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja476:4.4": "", "ja476:5.1": "", "ja476:5.2": "", "ja476:5.3": "pissāmi → pāyāmi (bj, pts-vp-pli1); pivissāmi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja476:5.4": "", "ja476:6.1": "", "ja476:6.2": "sakuṇānañca → sakuntānañca (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja476:6.3": "", "ja476:6.4": "", "ja476:7.1": "", "ja476:7.2": "", "ja476:7.3": "", "ja476:7.4": "", "ja476:8.1": "", "ja476:8.2": "", "ja476:8.3": "", "ja476:8.4": "yasmiṁ nāvisate → yasmā vivasate (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja476:9.1": "", "ja476:9.2": "", "ja476:9.3": "", "ja476:9.4": "", "ja476:10.1": "", "ja476:10.2": "", "ja476:10.3": "", "ja476:10.4": "", "ja476:11.1": "", "ja476:11.2": "", "ja476:11.3": "gacchāma → gacchāmi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja476:11.4": "homa appiyā → homi appiyo (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja476:12.1": "", "ja476:12.2": "", "ja476:12.3": "sataṁ → santānaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); sattānaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja476:12.4": "", "ja476:12.5": "", "ja476:12.6": "", "ja476:13.1": "", "ja476:13.2": "", "ja476:13.3": "Tuyhañcāpi → vāpi (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1, mr) ", "ja476:13.4": "mayhañca → vā (bahūsu) ", "ja476:13.5": "passemu → passema (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja476:13.6": "", "ja476:14.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja476:0.1": "", "ja476:0.2": "", "ja476:0.3": "", "ja476:0.4": "", "ja476:1.1": "ms22J_2412, msdiv27, pts-vp-pli4.214", "ja476:1.2": "", "ja476:1.3": "", "ja476:1.4": "", "ja476:2.1": "ms22J_2413, msdiv28, pts-vp-pli4.216", "ja476:2.2": "", "ja476:2.3": "", "ja476:2.4": "", "ja476:3.1": "ms22J_2414, msdiv29", "ja476:3.2": "", "ja476:3.3": "", "ja476:3.4": "", "ja476:4.1": "dr27.346,